  "topic": "navigation",
  "subtopic": "deduced_types",
  "title": "`auto` in templates",
  "summary": "Inside a template, an `auto` whose initializer depends on a template parameter reaches the type the initializer resolves to",
  "prose": "A template parameter, a class template's included, stands for its argument\nwhen the template is instantiated once, and for itself when it is\ninstantiated with several types.",
  "status": "supported",
  "issues": [],
  "files": [
